{"id":"9853288b97e63a4f","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-ACA0-transfinite-induction.md","title":"Arithmetical Transfinite Induction in ACA0","display":"thm-ACA0-transfinite-induction — Arithmetical Transfinite Induction in ACA0","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-ACA0-transfinite-induction","aliases":["62-thm-ACA0-transfinite-induction"],"display":"thm-ACA0-transfinite-induction — Arithmetical Transfinite Induction in ACA0","depends_on":["[[62-df-ACA0]]","[[62-df-WellOrder]]","[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","[[62-df-L2]]","[[62-df-derivability]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Lemma V.2.1","source_pages":[173],"source_pdf_pages":[191]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-ACA0-transfinite-induction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-ACA0-transfinite-induction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ACA0-transfinite-induction — Arithmetical Transfinite Induction in ACA0"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"649faa9c6d69237b\" href=\"?note=649faa9c6d69237b\" title=\"62-df-WellOrder\">62-df-WellOrder</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Lemma V.2.1"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>173</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>191</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>理论、内部良序与算术公式见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35af454d9caa8c9d\" href=\"?note=35af454d9caa8c9d\" title=\"62-df-ACA0\">62-df-ACA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"649faa9c6d69237b\" href=\"?note=649faa9c6d69237b\" title=\"62-df-WellOrder\">62-df-WellOrder</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a>；UC、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{S_2}\">\\(\\vdash_{S_2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(a,\\bar u,\\bar A)\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)\">\\(\\varphi(a,\\bar u,\\bar A)\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)\\)</span>；W、R 为新集合变量。</p>\n<p>上游理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ACA}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{ACA}_0\\)</span>，序谓词为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in V_N\">\\(a\\in V_N\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 的指定自由数变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in V_N\\setminus(\\operatorname{Var}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{a\\})\">\\(b\\in V_N\\setminus(\\operatorname{Var}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{a\\})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W,R\\in V_S\">\\(W,R\\in V_S\\)</span> 互异且不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 中自由出现。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar u,\\bar A\">\\(\\bar u,\\bar A\\)</span> 列出其余自由参数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\varphi,a,b)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}(\\varphi,a,b)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a> 的捕获避免替换，不将参数误绑定为前驱变量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA0\\text{-}transfinite\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{ACA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\bigl[(\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\\land\\forall a\\in W[(\\forall b\\in W(b\\prec_R a\\to\\operatorname{Sub}(\\varphi,a,b)))\\to\\varphi])\\to\\forall a\\in W\\;\\varphi\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA0\\text{-}transfinite\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{ACA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\bigl[(\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\\land\\forall a\\in W[(\\forall b\\in W(b\\prec_R a\\to\\operatorname{Sub}(\\varphi,a,b)))\\to\\varphi])\\to\\forall a\\in W\\;\\varphi\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>算术理解形成反例集。若它非空，由进展性每个反例都有更低反例，按自然数代码最小选择并原始递归形成下降序列，违背 WO。故反例集为空。这里量词明确限制到 W；只证明已有良序上的算术超限归纳，不给出迭代理解的层级集合，因此强度与 ATR 的存在性不同。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Lemma V.2.1；纸面页 173；PDF 页 191。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-ACA0","status":"resolved","id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ACA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-WellOrder","status":"resolved","id":"649faa9c6d69237b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","