ticHierarchy]]；UC、$\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。$\\varphi(a,\\bar u,\\bar A)\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$；W、R 为新集合变量。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"98c3cbeb95500b53","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"理论、内部良序与算术公式见 [[62-df-ACA0]]、[[62-df-WellOrder]]、[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；UC、$\\vdash_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-L2]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。$\\varphi(a,\\bar u,\\bar A)\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$；W、R 为新集合变量。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$a\\in V_N$ 是 $\\varphi$ 的指定自由数变量；$b\\in V_N\\setminus(\\operatorname{Var}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{a\\})$。$W,R\\in V_S$ 互异且不在 $\\varphi$ 中自由出现。$\\bar u,\\bar A$ 列出其余自由参数；$\\operatorname{Sub}(\\varphi,a,b)$ 使用 [[62-df-L2]] 的捕获避免替换，不将参数误绑定为前驱变量。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\vdash_{S_2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(a,\\bar u,\\bar A)\\in\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ACA}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in V_N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in V_N\\setminus(\\operatorname{Var}(\\varphi)\\cup\\{a\\})","display":false},{"tex":"W,R\\in V_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar u,\\bar A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sub}(\\varphi,a,b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ACA0\\text{-}transfinite\\text{-}induction}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{ACA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\bigl[(\\mathrm{WO}(W,R)\\land\\forall a\\in W[(\\forall b\\in W(b\\prec_R a\\to\\operatorname{Sub}(\\varphi,a,b)))\\to\\varphi])\\to\\forall a\\in W\\;\\varphi\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1990,"backlinks":[{"id":"0db76c21ee915f76","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"理论和良序见 [[62-df-ACA0]]、[[62-df-WellOrder]]；$\\mathsf H_\\theta$ 及其新鲜变量